Additional notice for amateur radio use:

This software transmits a station callsign inside the payload of Reticulum
frames. It is offered as one reading of the identification requirements of
47 CFR §97.119 and is not legal advice. Operating an amateur station is the
responsibility of the licensed control operator. Use at your own risk.
